      "poi_id": "p11",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Step into the last king’s summer rooms and imagine the old Đà Lạt afternoons. The gardens are as calm as a slow swing through the pines."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p3",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A pink church with a bell tower that catches the highland light. Stand back on the hill and let the whole city settle below you."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p14",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "The big glass flower by the lake is a fine spot to watch local life drift past. Easy on the legs, easy on the eyes."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p284",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Pull up a chair, order the grilled chicken with lime leaf, and let the evening noise do the talking. Ngon quá (so tasty) territory."
    }
  ]
